Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.85,0:20:53.18,ed-romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf49}Ha{\kf40}sha{\kf31}gi{\kf38}da{\kf61}su {\kf32}ki{\kf65}mo{\kf57}chi {\kf161}ni
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.85,0:20:53.18,ed-kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf49}は{\kf40}しゃ{\kf31}ぎ{\kf38}だ{\kf61}す{\kf32}気{\kf65}持{\kf56}ち{\kf161}に
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.85,0:20:53.18,ed-eng,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{}My feelings are ready to burst forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.52,0:20:58.27,ed-romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf12}U{\kf27}ta{\kf28}e {\kf73}lai{\kf58} {\kf75}lai{\kf30} {\kf171}lai!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.52,0:20:58.27,ed-kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf39}歌{\kf28}え {\kf73}lai{\kf58} {\kf75}lai{\kf30} {\kf171}lai!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.52,0:20:58.27,ed-eng,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{}Sing out, lai lai lai!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.27,0:21:03.49,ed-romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf66}Ko{\kf20}e {\kf33}wa {\kf35}do{\kf96}ko {\kf66}ma{\kf56}de {\kf150}mo
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.27,0:21:03.49,ed-kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf86}声{\kf33}は{\kf35}ど{\kf96}こ{\kf66}ま{\kf56}で{\kf150}も
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.27,0:21:03.49,ed-eng,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{}My voice reaches every corner of the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.78,0:21:08.70,ed-romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf92}Mou {\kf67}high{\kf64} {\kf68}high{\kf32} {\kf120}high!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.78,0:21:08.70,ed-kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf92}もう {\kf67}high{\kf64} {\kf68}high{\kf32} {\kf120}high!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.78,0:21:08.70,ed-eng,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{}I'm already high, high, high!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.70,0:21:14.33,ed-romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf56}Ma{\kf35}i{\kf29}a{\kf37}ga{\kf28}ru {\kf33}ka{\kf32}ze {\kf66}ni {\kf54}no{\kf141}ri
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.70,0:21:14.33,ed-kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf56}舞{\kf35}い{\kf29}上{\kf37}が{\kf28}る{\kf65}風{\kf66}に{\kf54}乗{\kf141}り
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.70,0:21:14.33,ed-eng,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{}Riding the whirling winds...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.33,0:21:18.71,ed-romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf18}U{\kf27}ta{\kf28}e {\kf73}lai{\kf58} {\kf75}lai{\kf30} {\kf171}lai!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.33,0:21:18.71,ed-kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf45}歌{\kf28}え {\kf73}lai{\kf58} {\kf75}lai{\kf30} {\kf171}lai!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.33,0:21:18.71,ed-eng,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{}Sing out, lai lai lai!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.13,0:21:24.63,ed-romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf56}Ko{\kf34}e {\kf30}mo {\kf34}to{\kf98}bi{\kf67}ha{\kf53}ne{\kf177}ru
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.13,0:21:24.63,ed-kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf90}声{\kf30}も{\kf34}飛{\kf98}び{\kf67}跳{\kf53}ね{\kf177}る
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.13,0:21:24.63,ed-eng,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{}My voice swoops up and down with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.95,0:00:04.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.07,0:00:05.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.67,0:00:06.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.59,0:00:10.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's really blurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.40,0:00:15.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan! Kouki! Stand beside each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.29,0:00:16.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.93,0:00:18.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.88,0:00:22.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.71,0:00:29.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. Next, I'll get a photo of you and Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.88,0:00:31.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't need to get one of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.09,0:00:32.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.54,0:00:34.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She'll grow up before you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.79,0:00:36.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You need to keep a record of these moments.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.68,0:00:38.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.13,0:00:44.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi-san, try to relax a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.55,0:02:46.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.25,0:02:55.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Rin! How many times have I told you not to go wandering off on your own?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.16,0:02:56.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.80,0:03:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're a big girl now. You have to get it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.00,0:03:01.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.48,0:03:03.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You clearly don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.95,0:03:06.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, can we buy this for a snack?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.66,0:03:09.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A snack?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.98,0:03:12.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It just looked really good...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.96,0:03:18.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Have you never had cereal before?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.07,0:03:21.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nope. I wonder if it's too much for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.98,0:03:24.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I don't mind buying it, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.72,0:03:27.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're really supposed to eat that for breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.15,0:03:30.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay to have sweets for a meal?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.64,0:03:34.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How should I put this? It looks like sweets,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.41,0:03:36.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but it's okay to have it at meal times.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.45,0:03:38.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You put milk on it, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.14,0:03:39.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.26,0:03:42.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe you can have it for breakfast tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.33,0:03:44.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yep, I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.06,0:03:45.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you want some too, Daikichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.06,0:03:48.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nah. I don't feel like I've had a proper breakfast after I've had cereal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.85,0:03:52.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Put the cereal in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.77,0:03:54.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.05,0:03:59.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're really bad at that, Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.03,0:04:01.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My hands are too dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.18,0:04:02.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're like an old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.67,0:04:06.26,Note,,0000,0000,0000,,TL Note: The line Daikichi uses here is from Mitokoumon, a Japanese TV drama centering around Tokugawa Mitsukuni, a prominent figure in Japanese history.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.67,0:04:03.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"Bite your tongue, knave!"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.79,0:04:06.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah! Mitokoumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.29,0:04:13.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, there are cherry blossoms down here. Let's go back this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.57,0:04:14.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.17,0:04:17.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're blooming everywhere, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.55,0:04:19.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The warm weather brings them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.78,0:04:23.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's huge...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.87,0:04:25.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's in full bloom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.69,0:04:30.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How about we plant something to commemorate you starting junior school?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.70,0:04:31.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"Commemorate"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.23,0:04:34.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I just it's sort of like a memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.50,0:04:39.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Every year, you and the tree would grow together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.84,0:04:41.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.20,0:04:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have a tree, too, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.10,0:04:45.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,At your house?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.43,0:04:46.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Near my parents'.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.89,0:04:50.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When I was born, they planted a fragrant olive tree,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.38,0:04:53.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and Kazumi got a tea olive tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.32,0:04:55.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A fragrant olive tree? Is that the one that smells really good?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.71,0:04:57.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.01,0:04:59.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've never heard of a tea olive tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.05,0:05:03.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Its flowers and scent are a lot more plain than the fragrant olive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.81,0:05:07.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So Kazumi always made a fuss over how it wasn't fair...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.06,0:05:09.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...and tore the flowers off mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.13,0:05:14.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And when I said I'd trade, she said she didn't want some stupid second-hand tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.48,0:05:18.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,On second thoughts, that wasn't a good memory at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.21,0:05:20.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So why am I wanting to do the same thing for Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.24,0:05:25.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, if we're going to plant a tree, it should have pretty flowers.  That way, it'll be more fun when it blooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.72,0:05:27.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Or one with fruit you can eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.26,0:05:28.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah! I want a loquat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.86,0:05:31.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Loquat?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.41,0:05:33.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, a loquat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.80,0:05:39.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I already saved some loquat seeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.72,0:05:41.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're going to grow it from a seed?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.30,0:05:44.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be all you can eat on loquats!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.03,0:05:45.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Assuming it'll actually grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.19,0:05:50.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,To be honest, I was actually thinking of planting a tree about your size.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.79,0:05:52.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So a loquat's no good?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.20,0:05:56.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, a tree takes a lot longer to grow than morning-glories and other flowers like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.49,0:05:59.75,Note,,0000,0000,0000,,TL Note: This is a Japanese proverb meaning that each thing will happen in its own time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.49,0:05:59.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's like they say: peaches take three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.75,0:06:01.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And persimmons take eight!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.63,0:06:03.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You really are Granddad's kid, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.86,0:06:05.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So how about loquats?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.52,0:06:09.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't really know, but what if it takes about ten years?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.94,0:06:11.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.79,0:06:15.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,By then, you'll probably me more interested in fancy sweets.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.68,0:06:17.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't imagine that...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.72,0:06:19.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.41,0:06:23.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If we don't hurry, we won't be able to eat them for ages!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.69,0:06:25.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right, right...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.50,0:06:29.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is this enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.36,0:06:33.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. If it's too deep, the bud won't be able to make it to the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.25,0:06:34.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.76,0:06:43.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You really couldn't be more like Granddad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.57,0:06:45.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's hope it comes out soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.82,0:06:46.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.77,0:06:50.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, do you know about ninja?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.27,0:06:54.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Kouki-kun said he's going to be one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.89,0:06:59.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They say ninja jump over a hemp tree every morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.28,0:07:04.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And the tree keeps growing bigger and bigger, so eventually they can jump massive heights.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.59,0:07:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you try that with a loquat tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.34,0:07:10.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.91,0:07:14.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.89,0:07:19.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Like that? {SO CUTE}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.12,0:07:19.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.43,0:07:24.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, hey! How big does a loquat tree grow?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.78,0:07:26.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,As high as the roof of our house?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.42,0:07:30.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, well... Yeah, probably about that high.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.91,0:07:40.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go back inside already.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.06,0:07:41.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ten times more!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.61,0:07:47.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if it'll start growing tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.32,0:07:49.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's probably a bit early.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.00,0:07:52.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Got everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.36,0:07:53.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.71,0:07:54.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.91,0:08:00.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They told us to get someone at home to check our timetable, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.06,0:08:02.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Man, what a pain...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.99,0:08:06.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nobody ever did this for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.74,0:08:10.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, she's right. It says I'm supposed to check it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.89,0:08:16.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.98,0:08:18.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's probably a police car.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.87,0:08:20.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There was a crime?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.33,0:08:21.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.72,0:08:25.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, attach this whistle to my bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.63,0:08:32.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.71,0:08:37.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If someone you don't know starts talking to you, blow this really hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.79,0:08:38.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.46,0:08:41.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And then run and hide in someone's house. It doesn't matter whose.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.41,0:08:42.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.18,0:08:43.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Or a store!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.72,0:08:44.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.94,0:08:56.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin! School!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.67,0:09:01.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Hurry up and get up! I'm going to be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.27,0:09:02.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.72,0:09:04.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.35,0:09:04.52,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.20,0:09:06.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You put milk on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.82,0:09:09.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can't I just eat a little like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.69,0:09:10.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.40,0:09:18.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pet dogs eat this too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.42,0:09:21.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's dog food! It's just for dogs!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.81,0:09:23.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.01,0:09:24.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.45,0:09:27.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Humans can't eat dog food.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.05,0:09:28.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Aw...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.59,0:09:30.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't look so disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.86,0:09:35.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is it good?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.69,0:09:37.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yep! It's yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.87,0:09:39.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rice balls are still my favourite, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.89,0:09:42.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's going to take a lot to beat them, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.22,0:09:43.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, your phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.70,0:09:44.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.22,0:09:50.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.07,0:09:54.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, but Kouki was so excited that he just ran off to yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.55,0:09:57.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, no, it's fine. We're good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.42,0:09:58.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.83,0:09:58.58,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.58,0:10:00.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.92,0:10:00.57,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.25,0:10:01.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, here he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.35,0:10:06.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.93,0:10:09.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun, you're covered in sticky willows!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.78,0:10:12.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You look like you've been living in the bushes like some wild animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.88,0:10:14.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not an animal!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.75,0:10:17.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And what's with your hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.04,0:10:19.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, go get a comb.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.00,0:10:20.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.29,0:10:26.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Geez... Your backpack is all torn, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.91,0:10:31.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And I bet you've been scraping that stick along people's fences, too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.84,0:10:33.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you a psychic?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.22,0:10:35.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyone could see that by just looking at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.36,0:10:38.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you sure it's not because you did it as a kid, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.90,0:10:40.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, you should be getting ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.58,0:10:42.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.33,0:10:44.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's that look for?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.83,0:10:49.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.66,0:10:53.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, wait! Wait there a seco{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.38,0:10:56.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.96,0:11:05.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun! Don't keep blowing it when there's nothing wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.58,0:11:07.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.22,0:11:10.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Quit blowing that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.51,0:11:14.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you keep blowing it, nobody's going to come help when you're really in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.86,0:11:17.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.06,0:11:21.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go on, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.17,0:11:24.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.91,0:11:29.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Be careful of cars!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.10,0:11:30.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.00,0:11:42.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.77,0:11:44.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.52,0:11:46.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're not supposed to take detours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.43,0:11:49.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't a detour. It's a short cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.41,0:11:53.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ninjas...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.93,0:11:56.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...always use paths like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.19,0:11:58.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Geez...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.87,0:12:05.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, it winds back and forth!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.58,0:12:06.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.08,0:12:28.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.31,0:12:31.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's no point taking a short cut if you're going to be slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.13,0:12:38.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not when you're supposed to blow it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.02,0:12:51.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun... {*sighs* Boys...}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.75,0:13:13.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That kid is a real piece of work...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.74,0:13:14.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.45,0:13:18.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Though, to be honest...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.01,0:13:20.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Most boys are like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.84,0:13:22.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.46,0:13:26.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You should keep the ninja training to jumping over the loquat tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.77,0:13:27.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.68,0:13:33.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.74,0:13:38.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That loquat tree is in commemoration of me starting school, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.59,0:13:39.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.86,0:13:42.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But your fragrant olive tree was planted when you were born.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.61,0:13:45.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So it's a little different, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.83,0:13:50.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess I don't have anything like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.87,0:13:53.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're so smart...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.93,0:13:57.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if her mum bothered to plant a tree for her or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.20,0:14:02.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if there's one at Granddad's.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.03,0:14:04.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, yeah, Granddad might've...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.69,0:14:07.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But you weren't told anything about something like that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.56,0:14:08.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.46,0:14:13.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And Granddad's gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.49,0:14:18.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If I don't know about it, nobody does.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.22,0:14:23.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I shouldn't have told her about my olive tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.07,0:14:27.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Your elbow's on the table again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.48,0:14:29.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right! Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.44,0:14:43.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shit...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.52,0:14:49.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't think we'd be meeting again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.42,0:14:53.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Neither did I.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.99,0:15:00.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is from the entrance ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.95,0:15:02.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.55,0:15:05.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? A tree for Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.50,0:15:11.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah! There is! There was!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.15,0:15:12.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.19,0:15:15.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes, well... I think there was one...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.97,0:15:18.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How can you not be sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.93,0:15:21.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Souichi-san was the one who planted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.11,0:15:23.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Granddad...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.11,0:15:32.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'd like to replant it at my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.19,0:15:34.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What sort of tree is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.81,0:15:36.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A small one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.50,0:15:38.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I mean... What type was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.76,0:15:40.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.53,0:15:43.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um... It's still small.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.40,0:15:46.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And the branches are thin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.92,0:15:48.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.88,0:15:52.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you really draw for a living?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.81,0:15:56.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I draw manga, not maps.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.68,0:15:58.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Which way is north?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.58,0:15:59.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,North?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.58,0:16:01.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The sun rises in the west, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.89,0:16:03.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've got it the wrong way round!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.47,0:16:08.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Forget the directions. Just draw me one side of the street in front of the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.42,0:16:10.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, I see. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.12,0:16:16.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, I have work, so I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.04,0:16:17.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.12,0:16:20.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to bother you at such a busy time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.31,0:16:44.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if I had a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.59,0:16:48.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Granddad would have planted something for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.46,0:16:50.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.73,0:16:56.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And if he didn't, all you need to do is plant another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.85,0:16:58.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,One that's six years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.37,0:17:00.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.45,0:17:02.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Would you like to see Daikichi's tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.85,0:17:05.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I want to see!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.36,0:17:09.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's really big, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.26,0:17:11.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's thirty years old, after all. Just like Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.94,0:17:14.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They've both gotten so big...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.94,0:17:17.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a fragrant olive, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.47,0:17:19.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right. I'm surprised you recognised it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.89,0:17:20.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.83,0:17:23.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This one is Kazumi's.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.70,0:17:24.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A tea olive?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.07,0:17:26.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.76,0:17:32.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you remember the big tree in Granddad's back garden?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.44,0:17:33.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.95,0:17:43.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's my tree. A tea olive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.31,0:17:44.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.42,0:17:51.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? This tree...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.92,0:17:56.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Granddad planted it for me when I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.24,0:18:05.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's the same tree as Kazumi-oneechan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.99,0:18:07.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.36,0:18:12.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When I was young, I always compared my height with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.07,0:18:16.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I really loved that tree, so I decided to plant another one for my daughter here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.48,0:18:20.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Was that a tea olive tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.37,0:18:23.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did Daikichi compare his height with his tree, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.45,0:18:24.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.65,0:18:30.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.11,0:18:35.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Long before the day we met...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.27,0:18:37.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, is that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.33,0:18:40.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The leaves are the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.96,0:18:43.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a six year old fragrant olive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.08,0:18:44.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The same as mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.74,0:18:53.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's us done.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.76,0:18:54.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I forgot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.50,0:18:56.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.69,0:18:59.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like I won't be able to jump over this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.71,0:19:02.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think I could, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.87,0:19:26.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We didn't even know about Rin half a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.20,0:19:27.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.87,0:19:31.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! The train's going to leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.20,0:19:32.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.09,0:19:33.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'd better go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.78,0:19:36.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll see you to the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.21,0:19:40.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.19,0:19:45.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Long before the day we met,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.72,0:19:59.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,we were already drops in the same river.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.72,0:21:41.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.52,0:21:43.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.94,0:21:44.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.11,0:21:45.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.52,0:21:47.75,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.83,0:21:47.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's some weird old guy outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.75,0:21:49.91,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,No, he's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.75,0:21:49.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.91,0:21:51.37,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, it's not like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.91,0:21:51.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where is he?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.83,0:21:54.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Listen to me already!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.47,0:21:57.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's Matsui-san! He's our neighbour!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.11,0:22:00.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't call him "some weird old guy"!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.38,0:22:04.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.35,0:22:11.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm... So... rry...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.45,0:22:12.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not at all. It's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.70,0:22:16.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It seems I gave you quite a scare when I called out to you like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.03,0:22:18.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.80,0:22:21.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, we've been terribly rude...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.57,0:22:24.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take care on your way to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.32,0:22:25.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.70,0:22:33.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.74,0:22:37.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When you ran away, you took Rin with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.96,0:22:41.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? But Kouki-kun made a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.47,0:22:44.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can rest a little easier knowing Kouki's around.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.94,0:22:46.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just a little?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.13,0:22:48.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course! You're still just a little kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.25,0:22:50.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not a kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.47,0:22:55.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're going to be late...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.56,0:00:06.52,Note,,0000,0000,0000,,{00:02}[Junior school entrance ceremony]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.52,0:00:08.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
